,120,18,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.30,Title,,0,0,0,,Zoro vs. KakuDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:53.30,Title,,0,0,0,,Zoro vs. KakuDialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oni Giri!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Damn that giraffe and Moss Head!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to destroy this tower?Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.79,0:02:28.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is...Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:30.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Gates of Justice? Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I can get there by following this?Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:40.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope Nami-san and the others are  already headed to Robin-chan by now.Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I also need to hurry and get this No. 1 key to her.Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd better get going!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bitch! Come on already!Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.95,0:03:11.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're finally on the Bridge of Hesitation!Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:16.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can see the opened Gates of Justice, can't you?Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It took a long time. It really took a long time.Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm finally here.Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.40,0:03:43.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once I've gone through those gates, I'll be the government's...Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, the world's hero!Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:55.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bridge that continues onto the other side of the gates is indeed rising up.Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:58.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It now awaits the hero's crossing!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:12.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is wonderful! Just take a look at the path to my bright future!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.10,0:04:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, for you, I guess it's the path to hell, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:22.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right? You think so too, right, Nico Robin?Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– No! – Hey, what're you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.08,0:04:34.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:44.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You... That's enough already, you bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it?! It's pointless to try and struggle!Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.23,0:04:59.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:00.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone.Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.23,0:05:02.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:09.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotta hurry! Gotta hurry!Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be meaningless if I  can't make it in time! Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:13.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can see something up ahead!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.46,0:05:22.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll reach our destination in about ten minutes!Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry and check the ships' formation!Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.93,0:05:27.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.64,0:05:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stand up already, you bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go, Nico Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this the exit?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You... Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:53.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here, you jerk?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.16,0:05:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You idiot! Enough with the attitude already!Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.50,0:05:58.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side right now! Just give it up!Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lucci, huh? So you're having a tough time against him?Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:09.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's Nico Robin? I brought two keys.Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.22,0:06:10.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I give you a hand?Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. More importantly,Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,please stop Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:21.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can get to the Gates of Justice  through the doors behind the pigeon guy.Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.77,0:06:23.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin has already been taken away.Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.36,0:06:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll restrain him.Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just super leave it to me, you jerk!Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm saying that if I had to choose, I like meat better!Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:57.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm saying it doesn't matter, herbivore!Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:00.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'll go ahead and take your key.Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.66,0:07:06.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I can't make it in time, it'll be the same as defeat.Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two-Sword Style: Nigiri...Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.75,0:07:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you get stronger when you wear a bandana on your head?Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows?Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toro!Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otoro!Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.58,0:07:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hirameki!Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.48,0:07:40.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samon!Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jumping causes blind spots.Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Scythe!Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body: SafeDialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm secure in my square safe.Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up! What the hell are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.93,0:08:19.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're so naive.Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you not noticed?Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffes have four legs.Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.40,0:08:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.19,0:08:32.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, are you gonna fight or not?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.15,0:08:35.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are you looking? My attack has already started.Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:41.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The slash attacks I directed upwards...Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,will deflect off the ceiling...Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.37,0:08:44.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and pour down on you!Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.75,0:08:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Cloudburst!Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.10,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Slashing pellets...Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:03.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I can't block them!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.53,0:09:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nose Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.11,0:09:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.42,0:09:45.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a tough guy you are.Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm flabbergasted.Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:51.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've trained my body, you damn gi-riff-raff!Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gi-riff-raff? I am a giraffe!Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.36,0:09:55.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gi-riff-raff.Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.99,0:09:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's wrong! I'm not gi-riff-raff!Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.03,0:10:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Shut up! – Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:05.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gi-riff-raff... Gi-riff-raff...Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop rambling. I couldn't care less!Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.48,0:10:14.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're mocking me, you'll pay for it.Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:19.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Likewise. You'd better prepare yourself. Playtime is over.Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:23.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, I'm gonna break through that Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:26.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Style:Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Draw...Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lion Song!Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:36.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Cleave!Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would you have cut me if I were iron?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my call as to whether I use  Iron Body to block your attack.Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:56.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. I guess it's not that simple, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.01,0:11:02.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One Gorilla!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.76,0:11:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two Gorilla!Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.14,0:11:06.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, bring it on!Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style...Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A strength contest this time?Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How interesting.Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nose Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nigori Zake!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.73,0:11:26.79,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What strength!Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.53,0:11:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You speak so damn pompously.Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:42.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the type who can't even imagine your own fall, aren't you?Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humble yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:51.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too!Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.34,0:11:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gatling!Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art.Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.41,0:12:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.85,0:12:08.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.01,0:12:22.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tsk!Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.93,0:12:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.44,0:12:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weapons Left!Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.97,0:12:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:42.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocket!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:48.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bazooka!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.73,0:12:59.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still haven't shown you...Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.90,0:13:03.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a wild giraffe's true potential!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop talking! Just show it to me.Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure thing!Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.64,0:13:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have a good look at the giraffe's power!Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:16.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Gun Battery!Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no giraffe like that.Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Nose Pistol:Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.86,0:13:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Turret Strike!Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It stretched?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See? What'd I tell you?Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That long neck is vulnerable.Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.49,0:13:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not totally true.Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.25,0:13:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick:Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,White Drill!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're more exposed.Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:48.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tsk! Just what kind of creature is he?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't miss next time.Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Gun Battery!Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.35,0:13:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha-Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! I pulled my neck in so far that my limbs extended!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:01.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the hell does your body work anyway?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.48,0:14:05.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's as if flour got crammed in and got pushed out as noodles.Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:07.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like a pasta machine!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pasta Machine!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just made up that attack!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I like my long neck, but long arms and legs have their advantages, too.Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm an expert fighter who turns unexpected situations into opportunities.Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just watch my technique using this long reach!Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:33.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Turret Strike!Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You couldn't come up with a new attack?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enough is enough!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style:Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:42.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dragon Twister!Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.77,0:14:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:57.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Moon Walk!Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He jumped into the upper floor!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:07.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pasta Machine!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've kept you waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My arms, legs, and neck... If I can control their reach at will,Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:22.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my swordplay will be uncontested!Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:28.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I employ the Four-Sword Style.Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can now make full use of the giraffe's power!Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.70,0:15:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You no longer have any chance against me!Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The giraffe is quite powerful.Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can retract that neck to avoid its handicap.Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You use the Four-Sword Style.Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.84,0:15:48.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:51.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He stayed my swords?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.85,0:16:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of those things establish that you can defeat me.Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.44,0:16:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style:Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.15,0:16:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spinning...Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.78,0:16:15.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leopard...Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:19.66,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna fly towards me!Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Balls!Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:33.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Impossible! I'm sure I saw through his attack!Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:40.43,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:47.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,he actually anticipated my reaction?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.87,0:16:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you so surprised about?Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:57.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've never been cut before.Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:17:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmph! Well, well. It looks like you weren't just full of hot air.Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.08,0:17:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I underestimated you a bit. But no longer.Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've mastered the Six Powers. On top of that, I now have the wild powers of a giraffe.Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.80,0:17:16.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Technique, power, or speed... You couldn't possibly beat me in any way!Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You won't have another opening to attack!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:20.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tempest Kick: Shuriken!Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Turret Strike!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.40,0:17:32.48,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:37.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My neck is like a whip.Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Whip!Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.25,0:17:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now to speed it up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:49.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fierce Giraffe!Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's this?! Where's your swagger now?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.39,0:18:02.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The four-sword attacks will  not stop. Surrender!Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Giraffe Fury!Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.77,0:18:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I come!Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:18.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What a savage assault!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.11,0:18:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, well! What's the matter?! All you can do now is block!Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't defeat me!Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:30.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're mere pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to go up against the World Government in the first place!Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:39.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that it's come to this, you must die in the name of justice!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like that woman!Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.39,0:18:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You son of a bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.06,0:19:09.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.25,0:19:13.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,For a moment, he appeared as a demon with three faces and six arms!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:17.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is with this guy?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.34,0:19:21.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got cocky.Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said too much.Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.06,0:19:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're tired of listening to me?Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use my strongest Tempest Kick, Sky Slicer,Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.14,0:19:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the one that slashed this tower...Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and end this battle by splitting you in two!Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.36,0:19:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it up. You have nowhere to escape.Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.78,0:19:45.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's on a completely different level from the demonstration I gave earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.67,0:19:52.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one who should give up.Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Demonic Nine-Sword Style:Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.20,0:20:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asura!Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.02,0:20:18.28,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,The demon I saw earlier!Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:20.99,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,His spirit manifests as such a powerful illusion?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Splendid! But it's too late!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:28.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's too late.Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:34.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dodge this Tempest Kick before making such a boast!Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sky Slicer!Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My slash attack...Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,turned into mist?!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I welcome pain and suffering.Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I chose a life of constant struggle!Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:11.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asura: Silver Mist!Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.15,0:21:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got...Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.24,0:21:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,a message for you from the junior boss of Galley-La.Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.45,0:21:54.62,Flashbacks-720p,,0,0,0,,When you see those guys, tell them...Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.62,0:21:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said you're all fired.Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.17,0:22:03.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie, huh?Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. That's too bad.Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not really cut out for much other than being an assassin.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.77,0:22:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could still work in a zoo.Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.44,0:22:24.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, be nice.Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.81,0:22:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry.Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.82,0:23:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Moss Head! Where's the key?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:16.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.25,0:23:18.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just got it.Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.66,0:23:21.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see.Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.92,0:23:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like you guys really put on a show.Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you guys cause the tower to slip even more? Is it okay?Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.71,0:23:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares? That's not important.Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.60,0:23:37.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we now have all the keys.Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.69,0:23:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.52,0:23:46.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry to Robin.Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.07,0:23:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.81,0:24:00.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just run! Open that throttle, boys!Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.16,0:24:05.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've gotta survive so we don't worry our Bro and the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.50,0:24:06.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ribbit!Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.34,0:24:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for your lives! I don't care if it breaks your legs!Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.35,0:24:13.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.51,0:24:16.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.22,0:24:18.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, giants!Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.64,0:24:23.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys, if you're just gonna ride, then at least be quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.31,0:24:26.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I agree!Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.56,0:24:30.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go! In the name of Elbaf!Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.61,0:24:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:37.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Hurry! Hurry up! Hurry up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.28,0:24:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chimney! I'm old! Show a little kindness!Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.66,0:24:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I can't keep running unless I refuel myself.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.50,0:24:47.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.71,0:24:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! He's gonna fall off! Pull him up! Pull him up!Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.13,0:24:54.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, you sure are demanding, geez!Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.59,0:24:55.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma!Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:57.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Hurry up," right? I know!Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.29,0:25:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bridge is finally complete!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.04,0:25:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't stop laughing!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.66,0:25:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Guards at the Gates of Justice! Are you guys ready?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:35.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir! The escort ship is already in front of the third column and...Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:38.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not it! Why aren't you coming out to salute me?!Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:40.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hero Spandam the Great is passing through!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.40,0:25:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! Y-Yes! We'll be right out!Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.47,0:25:45.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geez, those idiots!  They can't do anything on their own!Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.06,0:25:47.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nico Robin. Look at that.Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.52,0:25:53.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That small gate is the actual entrance.Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.69,0:25:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you pass through it, you'll cross the border between heaven and hell.Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.07,0:26:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's the moment my name will be engraved in history!Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oops. Where're you trying to run away to now?Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.10,0:26:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm actually sympathizing with you, at least.Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.52,0:26:31.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what can we do about it? Your life is worthless.Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.77,0:26:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and die.Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:39.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.58,0:26:44.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die.Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.54,0:26:46.00,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:48.50,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't die!Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.09,0:27:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've had enough, you bitch!Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.22,0:27:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stand up already and...Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? She isn't moving. What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.69,0:27:16.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's biting into the stone bridge!Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.24,0:27:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She just doesn't know when to give up! How irritating!Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.95,0:27:23.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's detestable how she clings to life!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.83,0:27:25.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's pitiful and vulgar!Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.58,0:27:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a criminal! The only way you can make others happy is by dying!Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.29,0:27:33.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why must you act so miserable until the very last moment?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.25,0:27:37.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I fear death so much.Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.80,0:27:43.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die!Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.10,0:27:45.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me, everyone!Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.89,0:27:50.19,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.02,0:27:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.32,0:27:58.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you that doesn't work...!Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.53,0:28:00.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yellow Lotus!Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.11,0:28:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.20,0:28:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.62,0:28:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My mission is to get through those doors as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.83,0:28:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no use. You shall not pass.Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.59,0:28:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong...Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body.Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.17,0:28:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hammer!Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.48,0:28:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? He doesn't budge an inch.Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.95,0:28:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was strong enough to blow Chapapa away.Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.37,0:28:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see. You defeated Fukuro before coming here.Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.91,0:28:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately for you, my power level is five times higher than his.Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.34,0:29:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed that you were able to defeat Fukuro.Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.14,0:29:09.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can say that you're already within the realm of superhumans.Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.51,0:29:13.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,As I suspected, he's an order of magnitude stronger than the others.Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.60,0:29:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, now you die.Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.65,0:29:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.02,0:29:18.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you do?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.25,0:29:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that steam?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.48,0:29:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gear Second.Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.06,0:29:56.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This doesn't last too long.Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.06,0:30:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'll stop him, so you go on ahead, Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.73,0:30:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin's waiting!Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.19,0:30:05.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, Straw Hat!Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.70,0:30:08.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's going on, but finish him off with that!Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.37,0:30:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said I wouldn't let you do that...Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,didn't I?Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.62,0:30:21.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! So you have powers too?!Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.84,0:30:24.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First, I'll kill you, Franky.Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.39,0:30:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Whip!Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.10,0:30:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you forget, Straw Hat Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.06,0:30:45.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At Galley-La, you went down with a single blow from this form.Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.69,0:30:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that? I just needed some meat.Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shave!Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.58,0:30:53.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol!Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.83,0:30:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rubber Rubber...Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.46,0:30:58.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.79,0:31:01.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jet Bazooka!Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.17,0:31:09.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.09,0:31:11.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please save Robin!Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.03,0:31:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bitch! You still don't get it?! I said this is useless!Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.85,0:31:16.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.47,0:31:19.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no hope left for you!Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.17,0:31:22.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.03,0:31:26.15,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're all coming to rescue me!Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.86,0:31:30.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super leave it to me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:28.67,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:28.71,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:28.75,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:28.79,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:28.83,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.83,0:02:28.87,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.87,0:02:28.92,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:28.96,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:28.96,0:02:29.00,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:29.04,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:29.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:29.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.12,0:02:29.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:29.21,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.21,0:02:29.25,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:29.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,Gates of Justice Underground PassageDialogue: 0,0:02:29.29,0:02:29.33,Captions,,0,0